{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — product page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-product  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.
  Then open your PRODUCT template (Edit code -> Templates -> product.json,
  or Customize -> pick a product -> Add section) and add Nurva product.

  Uses the page's own `product` object automatically — nothing to pick.
  Styles are scoped under .nurva and cannot affect the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
{%- assign on_sale = false -%}
{%- if current_variant.compare_at_price > current_variant.price -%}
  {%- assign on_sale = true -%}
{%- endif -%}

